# Typed errors

Throw `RutDigital.Common.Domain.Errors` for expected client failures.

- `InvalidInputError` — validation / bad arguments
- `NotFoundError<T>` — missing entity
- `AlreadyExistsError<T>` — duplicate
- `InvalidOperationError` — illegal state
- `ForbiddenError` / `UnauthenticatedError` — authz

```csharp
if (response.Items.Count == 0)
    throw new NotFoundError<Item>(id);
```
